-- 808(6): a conviction on indictment is not mentioned
#ASSERT `s 808(6) the penalty on summary conviction` `on conviction on indictment` EQUALS NOTHING
-- 808(7): "is not ... affected with notice"
#ASSERT `s 808(7) the company is affected with notice of, or put upon inquiry as to, the rights of any person in relation to any shares` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
