-- 811(4)(b),(c),(d)(i)-(iii): an organisation; disclosure to another with all particulars
#ASSERT `s 811(4) the request contains the information the subsection requires` `s 811(4) an organisation` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 811(4) an organisation` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 811(4)(a): name and address not given
#ASSERT `s 811(4) the request contains the information the subsection requires` `s 811(4) an individual` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE `s 811(4) an individual` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 811(4)(c): purpose not stated
#ASSERT `s 811(4) the request contains the information the subsection requires` `s 811(4) an individual` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE `s 811(4) an individual` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 811(4)(d): does not say whether the information will be disclosed
#ASSERT `s 811(4) the request contains the information the subsection requires` `s 811(4) an individual` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE `s 811(4) an individual` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 811(4)(d)(ii): disclosed to an organisation, no name and address of the individual responsible
#ASSERT `s 811(4) the request contains the information the subsection requires` `s 811(4) an individual` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 811(4) an organisation` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
