#ASSERT `s 819(3) the penalty on summary conviction` `on summary conviction in England and Wales` EQUALS JUST (Penalty OF `on summary conviction in England and Wales`, NOTHING, JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 3 1), JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 3 0.1), FALSE)
-- 819(3): Scotland
#ASSERT `s 819(3) the penalty on summary conviction` `on summary conviction in Scotland` EQUALS JUST (Penalty OF `on summary conviction in Scotland`, NOTHING, JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 3 1), JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 3 0.1), FALSE)
-- 819(3): Northern Ireland
#ASSERT `s 819(3) the penalty on summary conviction` `on summary conviction in Northern Ireland` EQUALS JUST (Penalty OF `on summary conviction in Northern Ireland`, NOTHING, JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 3 1), JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 3 0.1), FALSE)
