§§ `the duties as regulative rules (#TRACE; check.sh counts no assertion for these, so the expected outcome is in the comment)`

-- expected: FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 808(1) the company must keep a register of the information received` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES (`Action of a party` OF Company, Company, "s 808(1) keeps a register of the information received in pursuance of a requirement imposed under section 793") AT 1

-- expected: FULFILLED (day 5 of 5 calendar days that hold 3 working days)
#TRACE `s 808(2) the company that receives the information must enter it in the register within three days of the receipt` 5 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES (`Action of a party` OF Company, Company, "s 808(2) enters in the register the fact that the requirement was imposed, its date and the information received") AT 5

-- expected: DEONTIC BREACHED
#TRACE `s 808(2) the company that receives the information must enter it in the register within three days of the receipt` 5 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES (`Action of a party` OF Company, Company, "s 808(2) enters in the register the fact that the requirement was imposed, its date and the information received") AT 6

-- expected: FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 809(2) the company must give notice to the registrar of the place where the register is kept` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES (`Action of a party` OF Company, Registrar, "s 809(2) gives notice of the place where the register is kept available for inspection and of any change in that place") AT 1

-- expected: FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 810(1) the company must keep an index of the names entered in the register` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES (`Action of a party` OF Company, Company, "s 810(1) keeps an index of the names entered in the register") AT 1

-- expected: FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 810(2) the company must make any necessary entry or alteration in the index within ten days` 14 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES (`Action of a party` OF Company, Company, "s 810(2) makes the necessary entry or alteration in the index") AT 14

-- expected: DEONTIC BREACHED
#TRACE `s 810(2) the company must make any necessary entry or alteration in the index within ten days` 14 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES (`Action of a party` OF Company, Company, "s 810(2) makes the necessary entry or alteration in the index") AT 15

-- expected: FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 815(2) the company must restore an entry deleted in contravention of subsection (1)` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES (`Action of a party` OF Company, Company, "s 815(2) restores the entry that was deleted in contravention of subsection (1)") AT 2

